<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys 416,830 more shrs off-market.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys 416,830 more shrs off-market.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand said on Thursday it had bought 416,830 shares off-market on March 19 at $6.33404 per share, as part of its $1 billion buyback programme.</p>
<p>Telecom was up one cent at $6.38 on-market on Thursday morning.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
